      "section": "verification_checklist",
      "content": "Before applying a tool to an object for the purpose of 'looking at <object> under <tool>', verify that the object is already in the correct spatial position (e.g., 'under the desklamp'). If the position is correct, proceed to apply the tool directly to the object without adjusting the object's position."
